# Overview

This is an uptime monitoring website built with Nuxt 4 and Nuxthub, and styling with unocss.

## NPM package manager

Should be pnpm, but alway install package with `[ni](https://github.com/antfu-collective/ni)` and related command.

## How to use Nuxthub?

Nuxthub is a Nuxt module provider a complete backend experience on top of the framework that can deploy on many cloud providers, allowing developers to build full-stack applications.

### Database

Alway import `db` which is drizzle database and `schema` which define in `~server/db/schema.ts` from `hub:db`.

```ts
import { db } from 'hub:db'
```

Should excute command `npx nuxt db generate` after `ni` or edited database schema.
